From af74e548214a342cabacc5c80eb01eac135d1b61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:36:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add standalone offline Android app, content compiler and CI

Kotlin/Compose/Material 3 Adaptive app with Navigation 3 and Room 3, a
build-logic Gradle plugin compiling content/ into a bundled SQLite FTS5
database, offline progress backup/merge/QR transfer, feedback system,
and GitHub Actions release pipeline for Obtainium.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
